{"id":"2a8aeae215f43282","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Bounded Replacement Instance","display":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Replacement Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Replacement Instance","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-replacement-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Replacement Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb489a34bc2433c\" href=\"?note=1cb489a34bc2433c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,\\varphi,p,\\Sigma,M,U,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V\">\\(A,B,\\varphi,p,\\Sigma,M,U,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 是两两不同的变量码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 上的赋值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\)</span> is the structure-assignment predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（有界公式谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\\mathcal R,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\\mathcal R,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（集合模型满足关系，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1cb489a34bc2433c\" href=\"?note=1cb489a34bc2433c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(M,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(M,U)\\)</span> are the pure-membership language and its set-coded structure (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> are the transitive-set and free-variable constructions</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}instance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S(U)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(M,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y,z\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\\mathcal R,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land\nx,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\neq y\\land x\\neq z\\land y\\neq z\\land\nA,B,p\\in U\\land\n\\left[\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists!b\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\right]\\land\nB=\\left\\{b\\in U:\\exists a\\in A\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\right\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}replacement\\text{-}instance} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedReplacementInstance}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p;\\Sigma,M,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{Val}_M,x,y,z,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma=\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\land\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S(U)\\land\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(M,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y,z\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(\\mathcal R,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land\nx,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\neq y\\land x\\neq z\\land y\\neq z\\land\nA,B,p\\in U\\land\n\\left[\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists!b\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\right]\\land\nB=\\left\\{b\\in U:\\exists a\\in A\\;\n\\langle\\varphi,s[z\\mapsto p][x\\mapsto a][y\\mapsto b]\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R\\right\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an internal bounded-replacement instance for a transitive pure-membership structure: the source set, image set, and parameter are elements of its carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>. The formula has no free variables beyond the designated input, output, and parameter variables, while satisfaction and assignment data remain explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{